DESCRIPTION:You can run from resistance\, but it always catches up with you
 \, as Sami finds out in his critically acclaimed\, 'defiantly goofy comedy'
  **** (Guardian). Following last year's mega successful Fringe run\, multip
 le sold-out runs\, a sell-out debut tour across the UK and Ireland\, Palest
 ine: Peace de Resistance is back. As a Palestinian born in exile\, only to 
 be displaced from his country of birth by yet another war\, Sami digs deep 
 into his ties to resistance and Palestinian identity. What emerges is a bol
 d show that asks whether resistance can be funny.\nMore info: https://comed
 yatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/sami-abu-wardeh-palestine-peace-de-resistance
 /
